WEBVTT

00:11:00.011 --> 00:11:02.768
Now nobody says
I shouldn't have done this.

00:11:02.768 --> 00:11:05.797
Rather everyone appreciates
for what I stood for.

00:11:09.827 --> 00:11:13.998
As kids, we all are asked
to solve math problems.

00:11:13.998 --> 00:11:17.990
But in reality, math solved
many of my problems.

00:11:18.840 --> 00:11:21.280
Thank you for having me.
Dhanyavaad (Thank you).

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:23.540
(Applause) (Cheers)